Configuration-local Fletch plugins.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/yew/plugins/
Managed and data-local Fletch plugins.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/yew/plugins.lock
The package lock file described by
.BR yew-pkg (1).
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/yew/log
The diagnostic log.
.TP
