Workspace trust and plugin enable/capability decisions.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/yew/workspaces/
Per-workspace tabs, panes, buffers, cursor positions, undo state, history,
and crash-recovery metadata.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/yew/journal/
Crash journals for modified files.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/yew/backup/
Durable save backups when configured.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/yew/history/
Persistent command and search history.
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/yew/syn/
Compiled syntax-definition cache.
.TP
.I <workspace>/.yew.fl
Workspace configuration, loaded only through the trust policy.
